ty of publications. All accepted articles are made freely available online upon publication, promoting global access and the dissemination of knowledge across academic and research communities."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"small","children":"The journal covers a broad spectrum of research areas, including but not limited to the following:"}],["$","h6",null,{"className":"fw-semibold mt-4","children":"Clinical Medicine and Therapeutics"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"small","children":"This category encompasses a wide range of research in clinical medicine, focusing on patient care, treatment modalities, clinical trials, and therapeutic advancements. It includes studies related to improving diagnosis, treatment effectiveness, and patient outcomes across various medical disciplines."}],"$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25"]}],"$L26"],["$L27"],"$L28"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$L29",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$2a",[]],"S":true}
